# Everything the deployed site does not need.
# What ships: index.html, feed.html, problem.html, professor.html, css/, js/, img/, README.md.

# The sticker sheet the stickers in img/stickers/ were cut from. Source material, like design/:
# the site loads the cut PNGs, never the sheet.
download.jpg

# Design canvas — the three explored directions (Notice Board, Lecture Notes, Block)
# and the published bundle, which inlines the whole canvas editor into one 2.4 MB file.
# Source for the look, not source for the site.
design/

# Competition material. Someone else's document, and a 2 MB binary in a 150 KB repo.
# Use `git add -f` if a PDF ever genuinely belongs here.
*.pdf

# Local tooling cache and critique logs.
.impeccable/

# Design and product context for agents working on the repo. Read before changing UI, but
# nothing the deployed site loads, and PRODUCT.md carries competition framing that does not
# belong on a public page.
PRODUCT.md
DESIGN.md
CLAUDE.md

# OS and editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Never generated by this project, but cheap insurance if a tool ever runs here
node_modules/
__pycache__/
